NNAAMMEE
     yyppppoollll — ask version of YP map from YP server

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     yyppppoollll [--dd _d_o_m_a_i_n] [--hh _h_o_s_t] _m_a_p_n_a_m_e

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     yyppppoollll asks a YP server process for the order number and which host is
     the master server for _m_a_p_n_a_m_e.

     The options are as follows:

     --dd _d_o_m_a_i_n
             Use the YP domain _d_o_m_a_i_n instead of the default domain as re‐
             turned by domainname(1).

     --hh _h_o_s_t
             Ask the YP server process running on _h_o_s_t for information about
             _m_a_p_n_a_m_e.  If _h_o_s_t is not specified, the server polled is the de‐
             fault server returned by ypwhich(1).

